00:38:06.000 --> 00:38:55.000
nearly one hour after exiting the bar. It isn't known whether she stayed in the car park by herself the entire time or caught a lift to Dublin's earlier with Denson or Mallory before returning for her car later. At 10.08pm, Daniela's car pulled into Dublin's where she continued socializing with Denson and Mallory. At some point, Mallory announced that she was going to a pool hall called the Runway Bar to catch up with friends and would meet up with Daniela, Denson and Randy later at Ollie's. However, Denson said he had decided to go home instead of continuing on.

