00:41:21.000 --> 00:42:12.000
The fact that it made its final signal at 11.07pm indicated it had either been unplugged or that a fuse had blown, either coincidentally or because it had been tampered with. After this, it stopped sending locations back to the base. Denson then called Daniela's phone via Facebook Messenger. It is unclear why he did this instead of dialing her number, but the most likely reason is that Daniela had a habit of losing and changing phones and hadn't yet memorized her own number. It would have been even more difficult for her to remember if she was under the influence. Meanwhile, Mallory had arrived at Olly's after a short stop at the runway bar and was

